# mCode Studio keys. This file lives in mCode's data folder
# (~/.whisplay-os/apps/mcode/data/.env on a device); it is never part of a
# release and never printed. Claude Code does NOT use it: Claude signs in with
# your Claude account through `claude auth login` (Settings > Claude Code).
#
# Speech to text for voice requests (optional; typing always works):
OPENAI_API_KEY=
# OPENAI_BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1
